# Code owners for despatch.
#
# This repository currently has a single maintainer, so every path below
# resolves to the same owner today. It is still organized by subsystem
# rather than collapsed into one catch-all line, so that adding a second
# reviewer for a specific area later is a small, additive diff instead of a
# rewrite. Owners are consulted (not necessarily required) for review;
# review requirements are configured separately via branch protection.
#
# Order matters: GitHub uses the last matching pattern, so more specific
# paths are listed after the broader defaults they refine.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
*                           @gtvfx

# Application source.
/py/                        @gtvfx

# Build, packaging, and release tooling.
/scripts/                   @gtvfx
/pyinstaller.spec           @gtvfx

# CI/CD workflows and repository automation.
/.github/                   @gtvfx

# Documentation.
/docs/                      @gtvfx
/README.md                  @gtvfx

# Tests.
/tests/                     @gtvfx
